{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mfaEnroll"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK13MfaEnrollmentV","text":"MfaEnrollment","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/MfaEnrollment"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Changes nothing about the current session. In particular it does "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" clear the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"§17 decision memo: the subject has not changed, and discarding a warm memo on an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unrelated profile action costs a round trip on every check that follows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(§25.2 rule 3)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enrolment is two calls and this is only the first: the factor is not active until"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/mfaConfirm(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" accepts a code derived from the returned secret. §25.2 rule 4"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forbids a composed one-call helper here, because the human step in the middle —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scanning the URI, reading a code — is not something a helper can wait for."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/mfaenroll()"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\